 <h3><u>Wafa jiska padhe kalma</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Wafa Jis Ka Parhe Kalma Usse Abbas Kehte Hain<br> Jise Sajdain Kare Sajda Usse Abbas Kehte Hain</p> 
  <p>Who Pyaasa Pyaas Ne Jis Ki Kiya Sairaab Darya Ko<br> Hai Jis Ki Pyaas Bhi Darya Usse Abbas Kehte Hain</p> 
  <p>Lagaye Jo Bagair-e-Taig Ki Anbaar Laashoon Ke<br> Jo Hai Paikar shuja’at Ka Usse Abbas Kehte Hain</p> 
  <p>Jo Hai Shabbir Ki Quwat Ali Ko Naaz Hai Jis Per<br> Jisse Zehra Kahe Beta Usse Abbas Kehte Hain</p> 
  <p>Jo Tha Shabbir Ka Khadim Mager Sab Sahebaan-e-Dil<br> Usse Aaqa Usse Maula Usse Abbas Kehte Hain</p> 
  <p>Wafa Jis Ka Parhe Kalma Usse Abbas Kehte Hain<br> Jise Sajdain Kare Sajda Usse Abbas Kehte Hain</p> 
